// Bars and shops (FacilityType). Copied into the world when a scenario starts. The park builds them next to a valley
// station (within the lifts' stationReachMeters, on its land): paid at once (buildCostCents), open at once, then a daily
// upkeep (staff, stock). They serve the guests at that lift's base: guests between laps there.
// Bars (kind "bar"): lunch for up to `seats` guests at a time at lunchPriceCents, and snacks at snackPriceCents. Where a
// scenario has bars, guests only buy food at a bar: without a seat they ride on and try after the next lap; whoever
// finds none by the end of the lunch window eats a packed lunch (no money for the park, little mood).
// Shops (kind "shop"): a guest going home buys merch (merchPriceCents) with buyChancePermille, scaled by their mood;
// the goods cost the park merchCostPermille of the price.
// requiredLevel: the park level needed to build it.
